{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Form I\n</p><p>Consider the statements: (1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/7001c805eb35494f4fdfec0175ed35dd6ebf36f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\wedge q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> (2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf26ac1d6791e52a13a3726fb9f5495bea6e544e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\wedge \\sim q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> (3) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cbc67a9f4ebca7976f7419675ef26584ade5ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sim p \\wedge q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> (4) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d1884d991fb4823c05367e0de20802eef4590944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sim p \\wedge \\sim q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are statements.\n</p><p>How many of these imply the truth of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e046a72fe0dab9cbdaac945f298988bbd5d5d1af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sim(p \\wedge q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p>Form II\n</p><p>Consider the statements: (1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are both true (2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is true and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is false (3) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is false and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is true (4) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is false and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is false.\n</p><p>How many of these imply the negation of the statement \"<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are both true\"?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a5df6bd60d3f557056d999eb8f2079cb579a1ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By De Morgan's Law, the negation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are both true is that at least one of them is false, with the exception of the statement 1, i.e.;\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a4571b5466462a0c77c54b815b448d3c7904d58a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{p and q are both true}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The other three statements state that at least one statement is false. So, 2, 3, and 4 work, yielding an answer of 3, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4feb78447beef6c93631b0912fb24e7936b6dad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016230228\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3985/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12144:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016230228 and revision id 288510. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}